<h5 id="stage-3-the-full-message-forwarding-mechanism">Stage 3: The Full Message Forwarding Mechanism</h5>

<p>If <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">forwardingTargetForSelector:</code> in stage 2 returns <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">nil</code>, the full message forwarding mechanism kicks in.</p>

<p>First, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">methodSignatureForSelector:</code> is called to return the correct signature for the message to be forwarded:</p>

<div class="language-objc highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
